---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="BitEvo Cockpit — Active Telemetry">
	<section class="cockpit-section">
		<div class="container">
			<div class="cockpit-header">
				<div class="kicker">System Terminal</div>
				<h1 class="display">BitEvo Agent Cockpit</h1>
				<p class="meta">Live telemetry of OODA loops and server states.</p>
			</div>

			<!-- Dashboard Grid -->
			<div class="dashboard-grid">
				<!-- Left Pane: OODA & Bots -->
				<div class="pane left-pane">
					<div class="panel">
						<h2>OODA Loop Coordinator</h2>
						<div class="ooda-stages">
							<div class="stage active">
								<div class="stage-num">01</div>
								<div class="stage-name">Observe</div>
								<p>Поллинг RPC нод, маркет-цен и API бирж (Jito, OKX, BingX).</p>
							</div>
							<div class="stage active">
								<div class="stage-num">02</div>
								<div class="stage-name">Orient</div>
								<p>Вычисление confluences, тренд-фильтров и разметки режимов.</p>
							</div>
							<div class="stage pending">
								<div class="stage-num">03</div>
								<div class="stage-name">Decide</div>
								<p>Генерация предложений (proposals) и прохождение Anti-Self вето.</p>
							</div>
							<div class="stage pending">
								<div class="stage-num">04</div>
								<div class="stage-name">Act</div>
								<p>Отправка транзакции или бандла, логирование в контракт-журнал.</p>
							</div>
						</div>
					</div>

					<div class="panel">
						<h2>Active Service Bots</h2>
						<div class="bots-list">
							<div class="bot-row">
								<span class="bot-status up">●</span>
								<span class="bot-id">sovereign-1h-btc</span>
								<span class="bot-server">win185</span>
								<span class="bot-type">Trading</span>
							</div>
							<div class="bot-row">
								<span class="bot-status up">●</span>
								<span class="bot-id">sovereign-15m-scalp</span>
								<span class="bot-server">win185</span>
								<span class="bot-type">Scalp</span>
							</div>
							<div class="bot-row">
								<span class="bot-status up">●</span>
								<span class="bot-id">arena-bots</span>
								<span class="bot-server">arena-vps</span>
								<span class="bot-type">Swarm (93/152)</span>
							</div>
							<div class="bot-row sunsetting">
								<span class="bot-status sunset">●</span>
								<span class="bot-id">okx-nft-counterbidder</span>
								<span class="bot-server">fin35</span>
								<span class="bot-type">NFT [SUNSET]</span>
							</div>
							<div class="bot-row sunsetting">
								<span class="bot-status sunset">●</span>
								<span class="bot-id">binance-nft-new8</span>
								<span class="bot-server">win185</span>
								<span class="bot-type">NFT [SUNSET]</span>
							</div>
						</div>
					</div>
				</div>

				<!-- Right Pane: Servers & Logs -->
				<div class="pane right-pane">
					<div class="panel">
						<h2>Fleet Infrastructure</h2>
						<div class="servers-grid">
							<div class="server-card">
								<div class="srv-header">
									<span class="indicator up"></span>
									<span class="srv-name">arena-vps</span>
									<span class="srv-ping">31ms</span>
								</div>
								<div class="srv-ip">34.70.171.152</div>
								<div class="srv-desc">Sovereign Arena (93 active bots)</div>
							</div>
							<div class="server-card">
								<div class="srv-header">
									<span class="indicator up"></span>
									<span class="srv-name">win185</span>
									<span class="srv-ping">15ms</span>
								</div>
								<div class="srv-ip">185.231.154.149</div>
								<div class="srv-desc">BitEvo API & Core Sovereign</div>
							</div>
							<div class="server-card">
								<div class="srv-header">
									<span class="indicator partial"></span>
									<span class="srv-name">fin35</span>
									<span class="srv-ping">45ms</span>
								</div>
								<div class="srv-ip">35.217.10.153</div>
								<div class="srv-desc">OKX Bot & Parasites Brain</div>
							</div>
							<div class="server-card down">
								<div class="srv-header">
									<span class="indicator down"></span>
									<span class="srv-name">old144</span>
									<span class="srv-ping">timeout</span>
								</div>
								<div class="srv-ip">144.124.250.14</div>
								<div class="srv-desc">Legacy (Decommissioned)</div>
							</div>
						</div>
					</div>

					<div class="panel">
						<h2>Live Log Feed</h2>
						<div class="terminal-body">
							<div class="log-line"><span class="time">[02:15:01]</span> <span class="tag info">INFO</span> Syncing canon block from main Google Drive...</div>
							<div class="log-line"><span class="time">[02:15:02]</span> <span class="tag success">PASS</span> Doctor check: 0 violations, STATUS: OK.</div>
							<div class="log-line"><span class="time">[02:15:05]</span> <span class="tag warn">WARN</span> binance-nft-new8: market sunset mode activated. Bids capped.</div>
							<div class="log-line"><span class="time">[02:15:10]</span> <span class="tag info">INFO</span> Jito bundle RPC ping: Jito Block Engine is reachable.</div>
							<div class="log-line"><span class="time">[02:15:15]</span> <span class="tag success">PASS</span> Telemetry snapshot written to unified_state.json.</div>
						</div>
					</div>
				</div>
			</div>
		</div>
	</section>
</Layout>

<style>
	.cockpit-section {
		padding-block: 40px;
	}
	.cockpit-header {
		margin-bottom: 30px;
	}
	.kicker {
		color: var(--gold);
		font-size: 0.72rem;
		font-weight: 900;
		letter-spacing: 0.12em;
		text-transform: uppercase;
		margin-bottom: 6px;
	}
	.display {
		font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif;
		font-size: 2.2rem;
		margin: 0;
	}
	.meta {
		color: var(--muted);
		font-size: 0.9rem;
		margin-top: 6px;
	}

	/* Layout Grid */
	.dashboard-grid {
		display: grid;
		grid-template-columns: 1fr 1.2fr;
		gap: 20px;
	}
	@media (max-width: 900px) {
		.dashboard-grid {
			grid-template-columns: 1fr;
		}
	}

	.pane {
		display: flex;
		flex-direction: column;
		gap: 20px;
	}

	.panel {
		background: var(--paper-soft);
		border: 1px solid var(--line);
		border-radius: var(--radius);
		padding: 20px;
		box-shadow: 0 4px 20px rgba(0,0,0,0.15);
	}

	.panel h2 {
		font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif;
		font-size: 1.15rem;
		margin: 0 0 16px;
		color: var(--gold);
		border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
		padding-bottom: 8px;
	}

	/* OODA Stages */
	.ooda-stages {
		display: flex;
		flex-direction: column;
		gap: 12px;
	}
	.stage {
		display: grid;
		grid-template-columns: auto 1fr;
		gap: 4px 12px;
		padding: 10px;
		border-radius: 6px;
		background: rgba(255,255,255,0.02);
		border: 1px solid var(--line);
	}
	.stage.active {
		border-color: rgba(125,168,155,0.3);
		background: rgba(125,168,155,0.05);
	}
	.stage.active .stage-name {
		color: var(--green);
	}
	.stage-num {
		grid-row: span 2;
		font-size: 1.6rem;
		font-weight: 950;
		color: var(--blue);
		opacity: 0.8;
		font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif;
	}
	.stage-name {
		font-weight: 800;
		font-size: 0.85rem;
		text-transform: uppercase;
		letter-spacing: 0.05em;
	}
	.stage p {
		margin: 0;
		font-size: 0.8rem;
		color: var(--muted);
		line-height: 1.4;
	}

	/* Bots List */
	.bots-list {
		display: flex;
		flex-direction: column;
		gap: 8px;
	}
	.bot-row {
		display: flex;
		align-items: center;
		padding: 8px 12px;
		background: rgba(255,255,255,0.01);
		border: 1px solid var(--line);
		border-radius: 6px;
		font-size: 0.82rem;
	}
	.bot-row.sunsetting {
		opacity: 0.5;
	}
	.bot-status {
		margin-right: 10px;
	}
	.bot-status.up { color: var(--green); }
	.bot-status.sunset { color: var(--high); }
	.bot-id {
		font-weight: 750;
		flex-grow: 1;
	}
	.bot-server {
		color: var(--muted);
		font-size: 0.76rem;
		margin-right: 16px;
	}
	.bot-type {
		font-size: 0.72rem;
		padding: 2px 6px;
		background: rgba(120, 175, 208, 0.12);
		border-radius: 4px;
		color: var(--blue);
	}

	/* Servers Grid */
	.servers-grid {
		display: grid;
		grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(200px, 1fr));
		gap: 12px;
	}
	.server-card {
		padding: 12px;
		background: rgba(255,255,255,0.01);
		border: 1px solid var(--line);
		border-radius: 6px;
	}
	.server-card.down {
		opacity: 0.55;
	}
	.srv-header {
		display: flex;
		align-items: center;
		gap: 8px;
		font-weight: 800;
		font-size: 0.85rem;
		margin-bottom: 4px;
	}
	.indicator {
		width: 7px;
		height: 7px;
		border-radius: 50%;
	}
	.indicator.up { background: var(--green); }
	.indicator.partial { background: var(--gold); }
	.indicator.down { background: var(--red); }
	.srv-ping {
		margin-left: auto;
		font-size: 0.7rem;
		color: var(--muted);
	}
	.srv-ip {
		font-family: monospace;
		font-size: 0.76rem;
		color: var(--muted);
	}
	.srv-desc {
		font-size: 0.74rem;
		color: var(--muted);
		margin-top: 4px;
	}

	/* Log Feed */
	.terminal-body {
		background: #090d0f;
		border: 1px solid var(--line);
		border-radius: 6px;
		padding: 14px;
		font-family: monospace;
		font-size: 0.78rem;
		height: 220px;
		overflow-y: auto;
		display: flex;
		flex-direction: column;
		gap: 6px;
	}
	.log-line {
		color: var(--muted);
	}
	.time {
		color: var(--blue);
	}
	.tag {
		font-weight: 800;
		padding: 1px 4px;
		border-radius: 3px;
		font-size: 0.68rem;
	}
	.tag.info { background: rgba(120, 175, 208, 0.15); color: var(--blue); }
	.tag.success { background: rgba(125, 168, 155, 0.15); color: var(--green); }
	.tag.warn { background: rgba(255, 138, 61, 0.15); color: var(--high); }
</style>
